  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a47ae6b2fbf34564bb18344c47c22eea, type: 3}
  m_Name: DLG_SL0_7_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - text: Last challenge! Cactusapos were harmless but <size=120%><b>Snowmen</b>
      and <b>Fire Turrets</b> do hurt.</size>
    npcImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8726e1acf043ab7458c657ccfd002abf, type: 3}
    buttonText: Damn...
    highlightID: 0
    npcSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0acb53c3023e61e4fa590489c202df11, type: 3}
    jomaSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eca1355730476b6498f5c55edf9ba20c, type: 3}
  - text: Fire Spitters are <b><color=#e3304e><sprite=5>  FIRE </color></b> enemies
      and are <size=150%><b>immune</b></size> to <b><color=#e3304e>FIRE </color></b>
      attacks. If you dare attack them with <b><color=#e3304e>FIRE </color></b>,
      they will even start attacking <b>FASTER</b>.
    npcImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a45fb2ba6b66d0248841039a01baca32, type: 3}
    buttonText: FIRE + FIRE = CRAZY
    highlightID: 0
    npcSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d82c7893165324c46b9a9d627f9dba00, type: 3}
    jomaSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a310acfbd5b447b46949283447c83bc5, type: 3}
  - text: Snowmen are <b><color=#1d80c9><sprite=10>  WATER </color></b> enemies and
      are also<size=150%><b> immune</b></size> to <b><color=#e3304e><sprite=5>  FIRE</color></b>.
    npcImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aef12474eae64534fbef8c36a460a916, type: 3}
    buttonText: WATER + FIRE = USELESS
    highlightID: 0
    npcSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eab291c8a1f9984448aa94257e3de508, type: 3}
    jomaSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eca1355730476b6498f5c55edf9ba20c, type: 3}
  - text: Further on your journey you will discover and craft <b><color=#e3304e><sprite=5> 
      FIRE </color></b>, <b><color=#1d80c9><sprite=10>  WATER </color></b>, <b><color=#43dc4c><sprite=6> 
      GRASS </color></b> and <b><color=#f6ed2b><sprite=7>  ELECTRIC </color></b>
      helmets, but for now you may have to battle them with <b><color=#b5977d><sprite=8> 
      NEUTRAL</color></b>.
    npcImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aef12474eae64534fbef8c36a460a916, type: 3}
    buttonText: Let's do this!
    highlightID: 0
    npcSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38d73f45af347ee45bf759933e3d4966, type: 3}
    jomaSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f0a00122d1bc44608aabe6f939b2ecf8, type: 3}
